# React patterns

- Keep feature code under `src/features/<feature>/` with page components and `*Api.ts` helpers colocated.
- Shared app chrome lives in `src/app/` (router, auth, shell, guards).
- Prefer descriptive component names: `VehicleDetailPage`, `MaintenanceSection`, `ResearchFormPage`.
- Load data in the page/section that owns it; keep API calls in `*Api.ts` files, not inline Supabase calls scattered through JSX.
- Use domain types from `src/lib/database.types.ts`.
